            <div class="policy-info-box">
                <p><strong>Management System Solutions Company (MSSC)</strong></p>
                <p>Al Imam Saud Ibn Faysal Rd, Riyadh 12363, Saudi Arabia</p>
                <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@mssc.com.sa">info@mssc.com.sa</a></p>
